  <text xml:lang="grc"><body xml:base="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.ydrophoroi.dindorf1893-grc1"><div type="edition" n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.ydrophoroi.dindorf1893-grc1" xml:lang="grc" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_ydrophoroi"><head>Ὑδροφόροι</head><div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="597" xml:id="fragment-ydrophoroi-dindorf1893_grc1-597" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_ydrophoroi" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.ydrophoroi.nauck1889grc1:612">
            <note type="source">Scholiasta Sophocl. Antig. v. 1.</note>
            <quote>Τὸ δὲ κοινὸν ὁ Σοφοκλῆς συνεχῶς ἐπὶ τοῦ ἀδελφοῦ τίθησιν, οἷον καὶ ἐν ταῖς Ὑδροφόροις τέταχεν “Πολύκοινον Ἀμφιτρίταν” ἀντὶ τοῦ πολυάδελφον.</quote>
            <note type="commentary">Attulit Hesychius in κοινός, ubi Ἀμφιτρίτην.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="598" xml:id="fragment-ydrophoroi-dindorf1893_grc1-598" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_ydrophoroi" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.ydrophoroi.nauck1889grc1:613">
            <note type="source">Schol. Sophocl. Philoct. v. 1199.</note>
            <quote>Ἐν Ὑδροφόροις τὸν Διόνυσον εἶπε Βακχᾶν ἀντὶ τοῦ Βακχευτάν.</quote>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="599" xml:id="fragment-ydrophoroi-dindorf1893_grc1-599" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_ydrophoroi" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.ydrophoroi.nauck1889grc1:611">
            <note type="source">Photius p. 366, 13.</note>
            <quote>Ὄχος Ἀκεσσαῖος ἐδόκουν αἱ Σικελικαὶ ἡμίονοι εἶναι σπουδαῖαι. ἡ γὰρ Ἄκεσσα Σικελικὴ πόλις. Σοφοκλῆς Ὑδροφόροις</quote>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Ὄχοις Ἀκεσσαίοισιν ἐμβεβὼς πόδα.</l>
            </lg>
            <note type="commentary">Qui versus in codice trajectus est p. 365, 1. ad glossam Ὄχανον: unde eodem loco habet Suidas. Conf. Hesychium in ὄχος.</note>
          </div>
        </div></body></text></TEI>
